Qibla-e-alam Bahru-l-Ulm ke murshid

450
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:04,720
ka matlab tha jiski riyahish Mahal-e-Qazipur

451
00:27:05,520 --> 00:27:10,020
Ekademi Seher fis sheikh ke waaste tasboor-e

452
00:27:10,020 --> 00:27:12,480
-sheikh agar utna qavi ho gaya hai ke

453
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:16,220
sheikh ke sifaat unke khiyalat aisi quwwat ke

454
00:27:16,220 --> 00:27:20,060
saath mustoli, yani uspe taari ho jaye agali

455
00:27:20,060 --> 00:27:22,400
ho jaye ki apna khiyal baqi na rahe,

456
00:27:22,780 --> 00:27:25,900
to yeh fana fis sheikh hai aur nobat

457
00:27:25,900 --> 00:27:29,600
bai'in ja raseer garman goyam ziman tui

458
00:27:29,600 --> 00:27:33,940
maqsudam bas, yaha pa ruk jayenge yeh aakhri

459
00:27:33,940 --> 00:27:40,240
ka hisa tasboor jamane ke waqt mashallah subhanallah

460
00:27:40,240 --> 00:27:41,420
ab kitne bajeyenge

